msgid "0 表示不限。仅累计首次活动实际发放的正向经验；扣回不恢复额度，剩余额度不足时只发剩余部分，不补发差额。人工与原金额补偿不受限。"
msgstr "0 means unlimited. Only actual positive first rewards consume capacity. Reversals do not restore it; a partial allowance issues only the remainder, without later top-ups. Manual awards and original-amount compensation are exempt."

msgid "0 表示只授予荣誉。修改奖励会建立新版本，已有成就不补发奖励。"
msgstr "0 grants an honor only. Changing XP creates a new version and never tops up existing achievements."

msgid "<p>WP XP Core records account-linked activity, XP, task submissions and achievement snapshots, plus private notification preferences/read state. Public standings show participating accounts. Administrators can export personal experience data through WordPress privacy tools. Deactivation, updates and deletion of plugin files retain the ledger, balances and settings. No automatic expiry or personal-data eraser is provided: deleting append-only records without a reviewed accounting and identity policy could break balances and audit evidence. Site administrators determine legal retention and respond to erasure requests using their site policy.</p>"
msgstr "<p>WP XP Core records account-linked activity, XP, task submissions and achievement snapshots, plus private notification preferences/read state. Public standings show participating accounts. Administrators can export personal experience data through WordPress privacy tools. Deactivation, updates and deletion of plugin files retain the ledger, balances and settings. No automatic expiry or personal-data eraser is provided: deleting append-only records without a reviewed accounting and identity policy could break balances and audit evidence. Site administrators determine legal retention and respond to erasure requests using their site policy.</p>"

