msgid "只包含规则、成长与任务。不会导出账号、通知、审计、余额、账本或存储配置。导入保留未列出的任务，不删除历史；先预览，再显式应用。跨站内容 ID 和图片 ID 需要先核对。"
msgstr "Only rules, growth settings and tasks are included. Accounts, notifications, audits, balances, ledger and storage configuration are excluded. Import preserves unlisted tasks and history. Preview before applying; review content and image IDs when moving across sites."

msgid "只处理服务端已记录的首次奖励或评论状态补偿失败，并重新检查原事件和当前状态；不会扫描历史。评论补偿余额不足时不部分扣减，可补足后带原因重试。失败列表最多保留二百项，不是永久日志。"
msgstr "Only captured first-reward and comment-compensation failures can be retried. The original owner and current state are checked again, without history scans. Insufficient comment compensation is never partial; fund the balance before a reasoned retry. At most 200 failures are retained, not a permanent log."

msgid "只汇总有可靠事件快照的授予与撤销，不补造旧版本参与分母。耗时从任务版本定义创建开始，包含等待和未参与的时间；旧记录没有此证据时留空。"
msgstr "Only reliable grant and revocation snapshots are counted; old participant denominators are not invented. Duration starts at task-version creation and includes waiting and inactivity. Old records without this evidence have no duration."

msgid "只能撤销人工调整记录。"
